WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.160
Michiru!

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:10.510
Michiru!

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.510
This can't be happening!

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.340
Ogami...

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:29.070
Hey...

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.610
Hey, Michiru!

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:01.180
Can you do that again?
Your howling is out of this world, Shirou.

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:03.100
Michiru!

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:04.600
-It hurts!
-Sorry!

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:11.320
Are you hurt badly?

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.440
No, but it would have been worse
if I wasn't using my gorilla arms.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:17.030
I'm sorry. You saved me.

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:18.870
Thank you, Michiru.

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:20.200
Ogami!

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:22.990
It's the mayor! Pingua too!

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:23.910
To City Hall!

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:25.910
Get in!

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:36.550
<i>As promised,</i>
<i>Anima-City has been sealed off.</i>

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:40.140
<i>You'll secure</i>
<i>the citizens' safety now, right?</i>

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:41.810
Don't you worry, Prime Minister.

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:45.180
Soon, the beastmen
will no longer be beastmen.

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:49.350
Japan will be the leader
in solving the beastman problem.

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:54.070
Even though Ogami turned savage
like everyone else,

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:56.610
he returned to normal
after biting you, right?

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:57.950
That's right.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:09.040
Look. This is some of Yaba's blood
that has been kept frozen.

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:12.090
I'll add some of Michiru's blood to it.

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:17.760
The beast deoxyribonucleic acid
is being transformed.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:21.140
The savage beast deoxyribonucleic acid
has returned to normal.

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:24.390
In other words, Ogami returned to normal
thanks to Michiru.

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:30.190
Your beast deoxyribonucleic acid allows
you two to change your form at will.

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:33.110
If it's used on
other beast deoxyribonucleic acid,

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:35.400
it will inhibit savage morphing.

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:38.440
If we can create a serum,
Nirvasyl Syndrome can be cured.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:42.120
-Really?
-The Japanese government won't help us.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.830
This is our only chance.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.290
Let's go to Medi-Cen.
We can create the serum there.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.660
-We need to hurry!
-I'm not going.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:54.170
If they don't feel stress,
they won't go savage, right?

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:57.010
You plan to go into the city?
It's too dangerous.

00:02:57.090 --> 00:03:01.550
I lied to the people who believed in me
and claimed that I was Silver Wolf.

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:03.890
I can't forgive myself for that.

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:08.520
I'll help you out, Nazuna.

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.810
-Leave the serum to us.
-Right.

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:12.850
We'll protect the city.

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:13.860
Thanks!

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.570
When this is over...

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:18.820
-We'll party!
-Let's go.

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:31.710
-I'll take some of your blood. Get ready.
-Okay.

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:34.880
-How long before it's done?
-I'll need eight hours.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:35.790
It will be too late

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:38.590
if that beast deoxyribonucleic acid
termination vaccine is used first.

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:40.090
I'll go stop Alan.

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:42.180
Don't let anyone in here!

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:43.090
Shirou!

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:47.260
-You stay here!
-No way!

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:48.720
I could never just wait!

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:50.680
When will you understand that?

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:05.030
Where's your mom and dad?

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.080
It will be all right.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.250
Medicine is being made
to make everyone feel better

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:13.080
-and turn them back to normal.
-Really?

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:16.880
Until then, listen to music,
draw pictures,

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:21.300
and focus on doing what you like
to keep from getting upset.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:23.010
-Can you do that?
-Sure.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:27.930
Let's go play with some other kids.

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:30.350
I'll take this child away.

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:31.390
Thank you.

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:35.520
Déesse Louve.

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:37.860
Boris...

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:42.030
Please forgive me.
Alan ordered me to do those things.

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:45.820
We, beastmen, cannot defy the Sylvastas.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:49.280
But we've been released now.
Let us leave together.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:51.200
I'm not going anywhere!

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.370
Stay out of my life!

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.790
You are mine, Déesse Louve!

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:57.000
Let go!

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:59.000
You will accompany me, Déesse Louve!

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:03.260
I'm not Déesse Louve! I am Nazuna!

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:10.260
You really are a total creep.

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:15.940
Déesse Louve...

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:17.850
Why?

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:22.780
I've had enough of you!

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:31.410
What the heck is this?

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:32.330
They're drones loaded

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:34.910
with the beast deoxyribonucleic acid
termination vaccine.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.250
Alan!

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:40.340
I'll launch these over Anima-City
to treat all the rampaging beastmen.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:43.460
You're the one who turned them savage!

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:45.090
What are you after?

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.800
It's all part of a necessary process.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:50.930
First, it teaches the world to fear
Nirvasyl Syndrome and demonstrates

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:54.430
the legitimacy of using the beast
deoxyribonucleic acid termination vaccine.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.390
This is basically a demonstration.

00:05:56.480 --> 00:06:00.560
You put Anima-City in danger for that?
How dare you!

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:02.270
Calm down, would you?

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:03.570
Using the termination vaccine

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:06.740
to eliminate beast deoxyribonucleic acid
will solve all our problems.

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:08.070
It won't solve anything!

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:11.370
They can be stopped with a serum without
eliminating beast deoxyribonucleic acid.

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:12.280
A serum?

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:14.740
Nazuna's and my blood can be
turned into a drug!

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:18.330
If a serum can be made, beastmen won't
have to be forced into becoming humans!

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:21.420
Well, I hadn't foreseen that.

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:24.000
I went savage but returned to normal!

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:26.420
So don't use the termination vaccine!

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:28.300
I see.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:29.970
I get your point.

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:32.350
Leave the rest to me.

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:40.100
Stop!

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:44.520
Oh, well. I guess I have no choice.

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:51.280
Shirou!

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.290
Turn those things off!

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:02.040
I thought you were
a little smarter than that.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:06.050
Isn't it a great plan? The Silver Wolf
that the beastmen believed in

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:11.550
is actually human, so they become savage
and are then turned into humans.

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:13.760
You're despicable!

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:16.260
What? Are you planning to bite me?

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:17.470
How frightening!

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:46.420
Holy crap!

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:50.470
I wish you'd just butt out, you know.

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:53.130
You fucking scumbag human.

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:55.640
I won't let you destroy the beastmen!

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:58.390
Remove your filthy hands from me.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:01.980
What?

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:05.980
Now it's time you learn the whole truth!

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:11.990
He's a beastman?

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:14.860
He smelled totally like a human.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:20.330
The Sylvasta family assimilated into human
civilization long ago and controlled them.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:23.330
Hiding our beastman traits is easy.

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.710
Unlike you, half-breed beastmen,

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:29.750
we pure-blooded types
are the true beastmen.

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:32.970
Gaze upon the figure of a true wolf god.

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:44.140
Originally, beastmen worshiped
the native animals as gods

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:46.150
and imbued them with their power.

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:49.150
They would never mix with beastmen
of a different breed

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:51.110
and maintained their own breed.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.570
That's a pure-blooded breed.

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:56.570
Most beastmen can't stand
to interact with humans.

00:08:56.660 --> 00:09:01.080
They left the homes of their ancestors
and had children with other beastmen,

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:04.660
like you and the beastmen of this city.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:09.000
Only a few proud beastmen

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:12.670
never diluted their blood
and maintained their pride.

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:17.180
My form is proof of the pride
of the pure-blooded.

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:21.810
How audacious of a half-breed
like you to call yourself their guardian.

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:23.810
You'll pay for it!

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:28.650
Those extra heads
just make you a bigger chatterbox.

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:33.190
Bastard! You're immortal too?

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:35.530
Immortality is the right of the Sylvastas.

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:38.860
Only the chosen can receive the rites
of immortality.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:42.450
The blood of a thousand wolf beastmen
was collected and poured onto my body.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:45.660
That's how we obtained this power.

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:48.750
It seems the same thing
just happened to you.

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:53.090
But you're nothing more than a fake
made from half-breed blood.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.800
Who are you calling a fake?

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:57.380
A half-breed beastman is no beastman.

00:09:57.470 --> 00:10:01.550
Only half-breeds can be afflicted
with Nirvasyl Syndrome.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:04.520
Stress on the mixed beast
deoxyribonucleic acid of various breeds

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:06.390
causes them to turn savage.

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.940
It doesn't happen to us pure-blooded.

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:13.230
So just as has always happened,
we pure-blooded control the world.

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:15.990
We manipulate humans
from behind the scenes.

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:18.650
That's the real truth!

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:35.550
That's punishment for interfering
with my plans.

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.020
No!

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.500
Lay off, would you?

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:20.010
Déesse Louve!

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:27.970
Saving you ought to make me some money.
I expect you to pay me back.

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:28.970
Who are you?

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:32.020
-A mongoose?
-A mink! I'm Marie the mink!

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:40.950
Be the best beastman you can be!

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:44.370
Silver Wolf! This way!

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:45.870
My golden goose!

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:47.910
I'm not Silver Wolf!

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:50.540
You gave us a super bread crust.

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:55.580
Anyone who gives us food
when we're starving is a god.

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:59.050
We've run into more danger!

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:00.170
This way!

00:12:01.090 --> 00:12:02.380
We're surrounded!

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:05.850
How stupid of me to rashly try
to rescue someone!

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:18.730
-Are you okay?
-Pingua!

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:22.280
Stop those things! They're loaded with
a drug that turns beastmen into humans!

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:23.240
You're kidding!

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:26.780
Nazuna!

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:28.580
Pingua, get that other drone!

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:30.040
You can count on me!

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:45.050
Michiru!

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:48.470
-Michiru!
-Nazuna!

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:56.770
What's happening?

00:12:57.350 --> 00:13:01.730
I'm not sure, but beastmen react
instinctively when they hear this howl.

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:11.580
It looks like they're only interested
in rampaging beastmen.

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:15.460
If only there were a way
for all of Anima-City to hear this howl.

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:19.460
A live broadcast!

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:23.510
Listen! Jackie and the others,
turn on all the TVs you can in the city.

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:27.470
Nazuna, Marie, and I will go to
the concert stage and broadcast the video.

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:33.810
Damn those annoying spiders!

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:36.390
Where the heck
were you hiding those weapons?

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:38.770
That's a flagrant violation
of weapon laws!

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:41.610
Enemy drones approaching!

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:44.320
If you're hit by them,
you'll turn into a human!

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:49.490
After the spiders,
it looks like we're getting bees.

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:51.830
Be grateful we broke the law!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:58.000
Here goes!

00:13:58.500 --> 00:13:59.500
Yes!

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:01.960
Be the best beastman you can be.

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:10.090
<i>That's it!</i>

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:11.890
Hurry up, Marie!

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:14.350
Chill out! It's not that easy!

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:20.520
Don't waste your time.

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:21.730
Alan!

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:25.940
I don't know what you're up to,
but just look carefully.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:28.360
Anima-City is through!

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:31.410
Before the serum is made,
the beastmen will kill one another

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:32.990
<i>and the city will be destroyed.</i>

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.370
<i>Everyone left will be turned</i>

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:37.080
<i>into humans with the beast</i>
<i>deoxyribonucleic acid termination vaccine.</i>

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:45.250
A woman with arms like that
is not very pretty.

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:46.800
You're a human,

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:50.470
so why don't you turn back into one
and live a normal life?

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:53.510
Whether I'm a woman
or a beastman or a human,

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:57.100
who cares about that crap anymore?

00:14:57.680 --> 00:15:00.020
I'll decide what's normal!

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:03.810
I'll decide how I'll live my life
and what's pretty!

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:07.780
If there are beastmen
who want to be human, then let them be!

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:11.780
But stealing their right to choose
like what you wanted to do

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:15.950
is seriously creepy as hell!

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:21.120
Too bad!

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:25.590
Farewell, you disgusting half-breed!

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:34.600
Shirou!

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:38.100
I'm surprised you're alive.

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:41.730
The guys living inside me

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:44.100
told me, "Don't you dare die yet!"

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:47.320
They're the same ones
you call half-breeds!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:58.660
Alan...

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:00.830
is a beastman?

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:13.430
Trying to buy yourself time, huh?

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:15.430
That's right!

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:18.890
Until I figure out how to do that trick!

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:26.770
You're no pure-blooded beastman!
You'll never...

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:32.190
howl like a god!

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:51.050
What?

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:52.510
Wow!

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:56.470
I haven't lived 1,000 years for nothing!

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:59.680
You must be kidding! Impossible!

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:14.990
This is no howl of a god!

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:17.570
It's just for killing your enemies!

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:20.120
You want another taste of it?

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:21.950
Stop! Don't!

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:24.410
Please stop!

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:28.080
Is that...

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:31.130
Nirvasyl Syndrome?

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:35.130
How can it happen to me?

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:37.180
Just look at you now, Alan!

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:39.850
So it doesn't afflict
the pure-blooded, huh?

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:44.270
Before you lose your mind,
I'll end your life!

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:46.770
No! Please save me!

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:09.080
Her blood gave me immunity.

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:22.260
Why did you save me?

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.680
I never want to have regrets again.

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:35.780
Michiru! We're ready! Give me that video!

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:40.700
No way! The battery's dead?

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:43.450
Seriously? We've got to charge it!

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:47.120
Shirou!

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:49.000
Howl for us, please!

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:52.920
The only one who can save Anima-City
is Silver Wolf!

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:54.170
What?

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:02.010
The real thing is seriously awesome.

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:22.530
<i>At this moment, I realized</i>

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:25.660
<i>that Nazuna and I are different than them.</i>

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:30.620
<i>But I could understand Shirou's desire</i>
<i>to help others,</i>

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:34.710
<i>even though he was filled</i>
<i>with terrible sadness and grief.</i>

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:48.640
<i>It took a while, but the beastmen that had</i>
<i>turned savage were returned to normal.</i>

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:54.020
Get your limited edition five photos
of Anima-City's new mascot, Nazuna!

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.020
RESCUE DURING RIOT

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:58.940
<i>Security camera footage of Nazuna</i>
<i>helping a child went viral,</i>

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:01.780
<i>so she grew in popularity</i>
<i>with both beastmen and humans.</i>

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:05.570
<i>Nazuna says she didn't know</i>
<i>there was a camera,</i>

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:07.580
<i>but I'm positive that she knew.</i>

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:11.040
<i>Nazuna is really very cunning that way.</i>

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:12.660
A CITY WHERE I CAN BE MYSELF
ANIMA-CITY

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:16.130
<i>We've maintained Anima-City's right</i>
<i>to self-govern.</i>

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:20.760
The prime minister reluctantly confessed
when confronted with evidence of collusion

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:22.510
with the Sylvasta Conglomerate.

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:26.550
Alan also resigned as the chairman
of Sylvasta Pharmaceutical.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:29.720
I doubt he'll be appearing
in public for a while.

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:32.430
We will change this city.

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:36.020
To get humans to understand who we are,

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.360
I will invite humans in.

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:41.940
That way beastmen will also learn
about humans.

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:44.240
Do you think that's possible?

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:46.320
I'm sure it won't be easy.

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:49.120
But I will stubbornly persist.

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:51.580
Fortunately, I've got time.

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:53.160
We both do.

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:00.130
Shirou.

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:03.090
Is your shoulder better?

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:04.300
Yes.

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:12.180
See?

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:14.350
Sorry for all the trouble.

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:16.850
It wasn't your fault, Shirou.

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:19.980
It looks like they'll have
a beastman disease drug soon.

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:22.570
Good news, huh? You can go back home.

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:26.320
I'll stay the way I am.

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:28.820
I'll stay here for the time being.

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:34.660
Nazuna and I are the only ones
who have been both human and beastmen.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:37.000
I'm sure that what I need to do

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:38.920
is in this city.

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:43.630
Besides, I really like who I am now.

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:48.970
What will you do in this city?

00:21:49.430 --> 00:21:51.720
I haven't figured out exactly what yet,

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:54.100
but I'll find something
that only I can do.

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:56.560
I'll play basketball and help Nazuna.

00:21:56.980 --> 00:21:59.560
And of course, I'll help you too, Shirou.

00:22:00.190 --> 00:22:02.020
I don't recall asking for help.

00:22:05.110 --> 00:22:08.360
The first night I arrived in this city,

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:10.660
-I saw Silver Wolf.
-What?

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:14.790
You sure as heck were happy
about that festival, Shirou.

00:22:15.450 --> 00:22:18.170
That's why you wanted to celebrate
as Silver Wolf.

00:22:18.620 --> 00:22:22.920
From now on, why don't you take
the form you like whenever you want?

00:22:23.420 --> 00:22:24.500
Michiru!

00:22:25.010 --> 00:22:26.630
Let's go get something to eat!

00:22:27.170 --> 00:22:28.050
Sure thing!

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:29.930
See you later.

00:22:37.020 --> 00:22:38.640
I just might be able to change.

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:43.900
This city as well.

00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:50.910
Subtitle translation by Brian Athey
